[h1]Daily Interest[/h1]

[b]This mod provides players with interest rewards based on their current currency balance at the end of each day. It works quietly without bothering you with annoying messages.[/b]
[b]Note that cash does not generate interest: you need to save money first![/b]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]Features:[/h2]
[list]
[*] Automatically calculates and adds interest to your account daily.
[*] The daily interest rate is 0.5% (compounded).
[*] No configuration needed, it just works!
[/list]